Mount each repository's variables Secret into its runner Pod.

For every repository a session starts with, the runner Pod gets the Secret
named by omnigent_repo_env.secret_name, mounted read-only on the host
container under /run/omnigent/repo-env/<Secret name>. The volume is optional,
so a repository without a Secret starts as before. The server image installs
omnigent_repo_env from images/server/omnigent_repo_env.py.
A wake re-renders the Pod template with the recorded repositories, so the
mount survives a suspend. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

